WEBVTT

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:07.860
Well…

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:11.120
It used to be just fiction, but now it’s a reality.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.490
It’s becoming more difficult to write a vampire manga now.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.960
But your works seem to be selling pretty well.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.720
Plus you have offers from TV stations.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:19.960
You must be making lots of money, right?

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.540
Well, yes…

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:25.380
And you were actually bitten by a vampire, weren’t you, Yumi-chan?

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.550
I’ve heard lots of people are starting to admire vampires.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:33.640
I was vaccinated, so I couldn’t become a vampire,

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.140
but being bitten felt <i>so</i> good.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:44.520
O-Onee-chan?

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.650
Yuzuru-chan…

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.160
Onee-chan?

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.800
Nanami onee-chan!!

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.560
That night, under the faint moonlight,

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.810
I realized my love was over.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.310
It’s been a month since the battle at the chapel,

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:31.100
and it seemed as though the Academy had found peace once more.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:34.100
However, the wounds are deep,

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:39.690
and I felt even more distant from Akira-kun.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:41.990
Werewolves.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.360
The Earth Clan.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.870
The burden he shouldered that I never knew of.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:49.330
But that wasn’t all.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:55.380
Inside his heart, that person was always there.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:01:59.380
According to surveys conducted by the government,

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:05.260
30% of all youths answered “Yes” to the question “Do you want to become a vampire?”

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:08.430
Their reason was for eternal life.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.440
In any case, everything is going according to plan.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:13.440
Yes.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.190
But there is a rumor I am worried about.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:20.820
There seem to be vampires who are leaving the Bund and roaming about the city at night.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.570
The Vampire Bund is an impregnable barrier.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:27.200
We cannot have anyone breaking through and going outside…

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.830
Investigate the matter immediately and confirm its validity.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.130
I brought the plans for Student Council member applications.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:41.220
It really does seem that no one is planning on coming back to the Academy.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:42.140
I see.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:47.090
We have counselors who specialize in bloodsucking PTSD.

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:49.390
We’d be able to offer more assistance if they remained.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.400
We cannot force them to stay.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:55.850
She has two faces.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.900
The face she wears as she sympathizes with the weak…

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.130
…and the one she coldly executes her subordinates with.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:04.950
The same face she fought Akira-kun with.

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.950
I wonder which face her real one is.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.330
What is it? Have you been fascinated by my face?

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.490
Do not worry.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:15.210
You have a lovely face as well.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.330
Is that the same way you always tease Akira-kun?

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.720
At first, he was agitated over everything I said,

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:25.840
but he has much more composure lately.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.510
If I had said that to him,

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:30.470
“Yeah, yeah. Very cute,” is all he would have replied with.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:32.640
You looked just like him.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.600
Because I always look at him.

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.640
Watching him never gets boring.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:42.020
Um, could you take a look at the plans to get more members…?

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:45.820
I-I brought the wrong notebook.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.150
I’m just going to get it.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.160
Soaking in the sun?

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.370
You’re forced to become nocturnal when hanging around vampires,

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.340
so I guess you miss the sunlight.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.710
That isn’t your seat.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.270
Is it your precious Princess’ seat?

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:11.600
Then why not force me off?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.020
If you can.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:15.400
Would you really?

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.620
You’re… that’s…

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:32.120
This is my treasure.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:36.130
It’s a replica, but it matches with the person most dear to me.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.580
By the way, Akira…

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.380
How long do you plan on groping me?

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:49.380
What happened?

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:50.380
What was that loud noise?

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.270
Ow…

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.510
Akira-kun!

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:54.720
Y-Yuki!

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:55.640
This is, uh…

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.520
I-I was sleeping and fell off my chair.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:02.650
Were you waiting for the Princess?

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.440
Yeah.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.940
Did she finish her work?

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.360
No.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.070
It looks like it’ll still take a while.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.580
I’m going to stop hanging around the Princess.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:22.880
I might as well quit the Student Council.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.340
It’s too painful seeing Akira-kun and the Princess together.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:29.640
Princess!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:30.640
That’s…!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:32.300
Yes.

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.140
I was quite surprised.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.680
You don’t appear like the type who can write.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.680
H-How cruel!

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:38.770
How could you?

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:43.520
I know it was rude of me to read it without your permission,

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.150
but once I began, I could not stop myself from reading on.

00:05:46.440 --> 00:05:49.070
I must say that the story you’re writing is very interesting.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:50.410
I was engrossed by it.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.490
Stop lying.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.110
Why would I lie about it?

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:56.830
Take it from someone who has read both <i>Ulysses and Oliver Twist.</i>

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:57.580
I guarantee it.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.950
You are not quite up there with Byron or Rimbaud just yet,

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.960
but your writings are full of kindness and radiance uncommon for an amateur.

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:08.180
They are portraying your nature.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.430
It certainly isn’t something one could learn.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.340
It isn’t anything that great…

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.260
No, I know.

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:18.680
You shed tears for my sake as well…

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:21.930
…when I threatened you and shouted for you to leave.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.530
No, Akira-kun!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.570
That’s not how it was…

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:33.280
Now I have two things to apologize to you for.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:34.530
Two?

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.660
I lied.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:39.670
Akira did not give this to me.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.700
Please forgive me.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.370
I was quite envious of you.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:49.550
You had a relationship with Akira that was different from our master-servant relationship.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.050
Princess…

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.550
Yuki?

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:57.470
There’s nothing to forgive.

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:01.810
I like Akira, just as you do.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.730
I think we’re friends.

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.770
You consider me your friend?

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:08.990
Me?

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.070
Your kindness knows no bounds.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:15.150
I have always wanted a friend like you.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:18.740
Wh-What is it?

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:20.200
You disliked that so much, it made you cry?

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:23.410
I… I’m not that great of a person.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.080
I doubted you, felt jealous of you, and…

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.880
The same can be said of me.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:32.300
Try patching up the broken pieces.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.600
They may fit better than you would have expected.

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.720
Then we can be trusted friends.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.640
Just like Montgomery’s story.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.810
Though unfortunately, I lack freckles and red hair.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.980
If that is fine with you.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:45.730
Of course.

00:07:50.060 --> 00:07:51.940
By the way, may I ask you something?

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:52.730
Yes?

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:56.450
This novel has words I do not understand here and there.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.740
Like “tempt,” “aggressive,” and “C.P.”

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:03.000
What are they? Special words in Japanese literature?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.750
What’s going on?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.210
N-Nothing.

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.340
Right, Princess?

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:13.840
Please keep the novel a secret from him.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:16.010
Very well.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:16.850
I understand.

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:18.730
What is this?

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.850
Yuki, let me know if the Princess is bullying you.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:25.100
How awful of you to imply that I would do anything to such a cute girl.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:27.940
Sure. Very cute.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:32.310
What’s wrong with you two?

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:33.610
Weren’t you fighting?

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:35.690
We so weren’t.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:36.620
Right, Princess?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.530
Correct.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.870
We are trusted friends.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:41.740
Since when?

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:45.370
How wonderful it is to have friends who can share your feelings.

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:50.960
We had finally regained the happiness we had lost.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:54.220
But we hadn’t yet noticed…

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:59.050
…that one horrendous incident had already begun.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:03.180
Hey.

00:09:03.930 --> 00:09:05.260
What are you doing here this late?

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:09.770
W-Well, I was looking for someone.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.320
So I was headed to the Vampire Bund.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.440
Oh?

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.320
You want to see a vampire?

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.400
How convenient for you.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.740
Don’t show your fangs so thoughtlessly.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:24.410
You’ll rot my eyes.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:28.920
It seems that the rumor of vampires escaping from the Bund was true.

00:09:45.970 --> 00:09:46.640
He self-destructed?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.400
Are you a vampire?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.400
Please take me to the Bund.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.730
I’m looking for someone!

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.360
I cannot do that.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.120
Humans cannot enter the Bund,

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:08.120
and only vampires are located there.

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.830
The person I need to find…

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.630
Onee-chan is a vampire!

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.330
“Onee-chan”?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:15.880
Your family?

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:19.380
She was my next-door neighbor and took care of me since I was little.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.390
Could you tell me her name?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:23.680
Nanami onee-chan.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.760
Her name is Shinonome Nanami.

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:28.560
Damn.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.640
You’re pretty bold, aren’t you?

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.240
Despite your “good-girl” face.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:00.630
Very well done, piglet.

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:02.380
Come here.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.350
Shinonome Nanami?

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:18.400
The Student Council President!

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:22.780
We vaccinated the students who were attacked at the chapel,

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:26.540
but Shinonome Nanami had already been a vampire for too long,

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.280
so the vaccine would have no effect.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.540
There’s a record of her going into the Bund,

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.540
but there’s no trace of her at the address we assigned to her.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.670
Then what about the students who were sent there along with the President?

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.090
The same for them.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.430
Around ten of the people that registered are missing.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.590
They may not even be in the Bund anymore.

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:52.260
If someone is able to take ten people out of the Bund in secret,

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:54.560
their organizational capabilities must be quite impressive.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.940
Is it that Telomere organization?

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.270
I do not know.

00:11:58.270 --> 00:12:00.320
We shall set up a net and gather information.

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:02.570
Only then will we catch their tail.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.580
But didn’t the one who controlled her, Jean Marais, die?

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:10.500
Perhaps she is now working under a new master.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.250
Why would she?

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:14.630
She is but a person, after all.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:19.270
Perhaps she was a target of agony or attacks we could never understand,

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.000
and they took advantage of that.

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:23.680
Attacks…

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:24.800
Do not worry.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.680
I will save Shinonome Nanami.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:31.050
You wait here with Yuzuru.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.180
Let’s go, Akira.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:43.570
Yuzuru-chan…

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.320
What will you do with him?

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:50.200
Make him a vampire too?

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.450
Your Majesty.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.830
You seem to have become awfully corrupt since I last saw you.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.710
By the blood vow, obey your Queen’s order.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:02.970
Shinonome Nanami, return to the Bund with me.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:05.460
What’s the matter?

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:07.210
Will you disobey my order?

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.100
So they did overwrite my vow.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:12.840
Akira!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:17.220
Akira?

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.480
I’m fine.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:19.730
Unforgivable!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.390
Princess!

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:23.610
Vera-san, they have reinforcements nearby.

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.820
Nest 1 to Fang Leader.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:26.860
I need backup.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.120
Fang Leader, Roger!

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:30.870
Where is Her Highness?

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:31.990
I’ll catch up in a second.

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:33.740
I’m also headed your way.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.920
Shinonome Nanami, cease your running.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:43.000
I will do anything.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.420
Let me save you.

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:46.680
You’re awfully kind, aren’t you?

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:53.430
The head of the night race is showing concern for such a filthy vampire?

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.300
Unbelievable.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:56.940
We haven’t met before, have we?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.390
I am Hysterica.

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:00.190
Nice to meet you.

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.690
Are you her new master?

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.570
Hysterica, what are you planning to do by gathering these vampires?

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:08.990
Princess, stay back.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.610
Are you the rumored wolf boy?

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:12.740
How brave.

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:14.530
But you’re heavily outnumbered.

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:16.490
Can you take all of them on by yourself?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.250
Hiko?

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:21.380
Heed my words!

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.260
Some of you must have been forced to become vampires.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.130
Join my kingdom, and come under my care.

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:33.010
If you do, I swear to protect you and take care of you at all costs.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:35.890
Are you an idiot, acting like such a goody-two-shoes?

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:39.020
You’re technically the Vampire Queen!

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:43.350
Technically? I am by every meaning the Queen of the Vampires.

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:45.030
You’ve begun to show your true character.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:48.030
You should watch your mouth if you’re trying to act elegant.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:49.770
Get them!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:05.040
We, the Beowulf Elite Eight, under orders of Sir Regendorf,

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:08.500
have come to protect you, Your Highness.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.680
Your orders, Your Majesty?

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.630
Do not attack the head vampire or the girl.

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:16.930
Feel free to turn everyone else into ash.

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:17.930
Understood.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:20.310
Prove your loyalty to me.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.560
Fight to your hearts’ content, wolf boys!

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.310
Everyone, draw!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:47.500
As I would expect of the Queen’s loyal dogs.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.670
This won’t be easy.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:51.920
Princess Mina!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.550
I shall have you sing.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.550
Nanami!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.060
Princess, don’t run off on your own.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:04.930
Don’t go, Nanami!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.850
You’re ignoring me and worrying about her?

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:10.110
How dare you look down on me!

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:12.990
Vera.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:14.730
Please leave this to me.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:15.990
I will then.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.620
My, long time no see.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:24.500
Veratos, was it in the 1900s when I saw you last?

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.130
It was 1918 in Paris, Francesca.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.460
Call me Hysterica.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.630
I go by that for now.

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.920
You changed your name again?

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:38.640
Is that how you’ve constantly switched your masters?

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:43.640
I don’t show eternal devotion to one master like you.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:46.400
And now you’re Telomere’s slave?

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.400
What is with that outfit?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:53.900
Weren’t you referred to as the “Black Ruby” in high society, Veratos?

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:58.820
You should’ve joined me back then.

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:01.160
You could’ve gained anything.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.580
You will never understand.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.700
I don’t desire anything anymore.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:08.370
Nothing apart from Her Highness’ trust.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:11.500
Why do you devote yourself to her?

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:16.680
She’s just a fake queen who acts like a leader of some cage she created.

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:17.680
Silence!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:21.930
If you dare to insult Her Highness any further, I won’t hold back, Hysterica!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.220
How interesting!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.810
We’ll settle our battle from ninety years ago right here!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.070
Yuzuru-kun?

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:35.820
Onee-chan.

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:39.030
What’s wrong?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:39.820
Where’s your mom?

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.780
On another date again?

00:17:43.780 --> 00:17:46.080
Does she even think about her child?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:49.790
Come with me.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:50.960
I’m also alone.

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.960
I’ll cook dinner, so let’s eat together.

00:17:55.710 --> 00:17:57.470
Are you lonely, too?

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.220
Of course not.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:01.340
I have you, Yuzuru-chan.

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:02.220
Onee-chan…

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:03.350
Don’t go!

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.220
Don’t go, Onee-chan!

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:06.800
Don’t go!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:11.480
Nanami, you must hate me.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:12.810
I do.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:13.940
I hate you.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.810
Not because you made me this way.

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:17.320
I don’t care about that!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.730
I pretended like I didn’t know.

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:20.740
I was hiding it with everything I had!

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:22.740
That boy?

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.990
Don’t mention him!

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:29.250
If he found out about such ugly, shameful feelings…

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.500
But I can’t stop myself.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.870
I just can’t!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:37.260
Even now, I long for him so much that my chest feels like it will burst!

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:39.010
Kill me. Kill me.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.510
Kill me before I taint him.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:42.760
Nanami.

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:47.020
Kill me before he starts to hate me!

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:48.270
Onee-chan!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:51.520
Yuzuru-chan…

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:52.770
Onee-chan…

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.890
No, don’t look at me!

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:56.030
Please don’t look at me!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.230
Onee-chan!

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:58.780
Don’t come!

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.400
Didn’t you hear her?

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:03.530
Yuzuru!

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:08.040
Vera.

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.660
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:11.790
She caught me by surprise.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:17.050
It seems that I’ve missed something awfully interesting.

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:20.680
Your Highness, unfortunately, I must take my leave here.

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.430
Look forward to the rest of my plan.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.310
Hysterica, what are you planning?

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:29.430
Something that will display the power of vampires to those fragile humans.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.560
It’ll be a very special event.

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:32.940
You’re not going anywhere!

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:35.190
My, aren’t you persistent?

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:36.810
Move!

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:39.190
Watch out!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.030
Your Highness!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:49.620
I am fine.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:51.450
Akira protected me.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.580
Another self-destruction.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:58.920
Telomere…

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:04.550
It appears they have come up with a better trick than stuffing their stomachs with bombs.

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:08.060
Dance with the Vampire Maids.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.230
Part… I forget.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.320
Here’s the original author.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:13.230
Ah, hello.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:15.830
Hey, why aren’t we getting much screen time lately?

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:16.830
Well, don’t blame me.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.620
How could I do anything with your attitude?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:19.290
Wow.

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:20.740
The problem’s revealed now…

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.250
And don’t ask me.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:23.880
Yoshino-san does series composition.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.490
Huh? You’re not writing it?

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:28.920
Wait, you don’t think the original author does the anime, do you?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.050
You don’t?

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:31.750
My grandma does it.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:35.000
So I was wrong…
